5,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic and observation will be our best tools here. Let's see how everyone behaves.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm gonna find the werewolf in no time! This is so exciting!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet everyone. I hope we can all work together harmoniously to find the truth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will be observing. It is important to assess the situation carefully before drawing any conclusions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Ryuji. The truth often reveals itself to those who can wait and listen.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Indeed. For now, we have no information. I'm curious to see who will claim a role first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Maybe I should guess! Is it Servas? No, he's too nice! Is it Ryuji? He's too quiet!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Now, now, Sakura. Let's not rush into accusations. We should get to know each other first.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"A youthful spirit is wonderful, Sakura. But remember, the wolf often wears the skin of a lamb.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,A fair point. We should be wary of those who try to steer the conversation too aggressively.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Oh! Does that mean I'm being too aggressive? Sorry! I'm just excited!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"You're just being yourself, Sakura. There's nothing wrong with that.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
