31,1,1,talk,Servas,,A new day brings new insights. I wonder what the night has revealed to our Seer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"If the Seer is among us and found something, they might be hesitant to speak too early.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I wonder who the Seer is! Please tell us if you found the werewolf!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Sakura. If we have a lead, it would be helpful for the village.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold and direct claim, Ryuji. Are you certain of your divination?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"What? That's absurd. Ryuji, are you trying to frame me by pretending to be the Seer?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! Ryuji already found them?! That was fast! Is it really Mizuki?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is quite sudden. Ryuji, are you really the Seer? Mizuki, what do you have to say?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. My result was clear. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"In my experience, the first accusation can be a gamble. However, Ryuji's conviction is strong.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,He's lying. He's likely the werewolf or the possessed trying to eliminate me early. It's a classic play.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But Ryuji is always so serious! I don't think he'd lie just for fun!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. Ryuji is usually very cautious, so for him to be this certain is unusual.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I base my judgment on the fact provided to me. There is no reason to lie.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If we execute the wrong person, we lose a valuable ally. But if we keep the wolf, we lose a life.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If you vote for me, you're playing right into the hands of the wolf. Think logically.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I believe Ryuji! I'm voting for Mizuki!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,I trust Ryuji's reliability in this matter. I will vote with him.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The choice is clear.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
